//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// HOW THIS CONNECTS TO MAPGROUPOOS.XML
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*
STEP 1 (THIS FILE):

Define group:

<group name="MilitaryRoadblock">...</group>


STEP 2 (mapgrouppos.xml):

Place group in world:

<group name="MilitaryRoadblock" pos="5400 3000" />

RESULT:

Entire structure spawns at that coordinate.
*/



//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// COMMON MISTAKES
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

/*

1. WRONG CLASSNAME
Land_Barrack ❌
Land_Mil_Barracks ✔

-------------------------

2. BAD ROTATION
rpy missing → objects face random directions

-------------------------

3. FLOATING OBJECTS
pos="0 5 0" → floating in air

-------------------------

4. UNDERGROUND OBJECTS
pos="0 -2 0" → buried in terrain

-------------------------

5. NOT UNIQUE GROUP NAME
Two groups with same name → conflicts
*/



